<p>Shehe har dosara ki rehlat hai,<br>
Deen ke peshwa ki rehlat hai.</p>

<p>Sar barehna hai Anbiya saare,<br>
Sarware Anbiya ki rehlat hai.</p>

<p>Ahlebaite Rasool rote hai,<br>
Peeto sar Mustafa ki rehlat hai.</p>

<p>Daare fani se jarahe hai Rasool,<br>
Ashraful Anbiya ki rehlat hai.</p>

<p>Jo shafa-at karega mehshar me,<br>
Us shafiulwara ki rehlat hai.</p>

<p>Gham se phat'ta hai Fatima ka ghar,<br>
Sayyadul Anbiya ki rehlat hai.</p>